# ADR-0009: an untrusted (Checking) verdict must not open OR move an episode. The
# point-event model's startup bug burned the cooldown here; the episode model's
# sibling hazard is starting the recovery clock on an ongoing episode because the
# first sample after a restart has no verdict. Drop the guard and the open swap
# episode moves to Recovering against a green reading.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/episode.rs
test: nothing_opens_or_moves_while_the_verdict_is_still_checking
---OLD---
    if pressure.level == Level::Checking {
        return Reconciled::default();
    }
---NEW---
